bettiStrataExamples -- a hash table consisting of examples for each of the 19 Betti strata
******************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        bettiStrataExamples S
  * Inputs:
      * S, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, a polynomial ring with 4
        variables
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, Whose keys are strings
        representing each Betti table strata, and whose values are matrices of
        scalars over the ring $S$

Description
===========

The result is a hash table whose keys are the names of the 19 Betti table
strata for quaternary quartics.  For each, the value is a matrix whose columns
represent points.  The quartic corresponding to this matrix is the sum of the
4th powers of the corresponding linear forms.

