|o3 = 2x  + 2x x  + 2x  + 2x x  + 2x x  + 2x  + 2x x  + 2x x  + 2x x  + 2x |
|       0     0 1     1     0 2     1 2     2     0 3     1 3     2 3     3|
|                                                                          |
|o3 : R                                                                    |
