|                                                               |
|o10 : Ideal of U                                               |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

We take the residual in this complete intersection of the $\PP^3_a$.

+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : X7 = CI1222:P3a;   -- the 3-fold X7 linked (1,2,2,2) to PL|
|                                                                |
