|                                              |
|             0 1 2 3 4                        |
|o15 = total: 1 5 9 7 2                        |
|          0: 1 2 1 . .                        |
|          1: . 1 2 1 .                        |
|          2: . . . . .                        |
|          3: . 2 6 6 2                        |
|                                              |
|o15 : BettiTally                              |
+----------------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : X15=intersect(X7,X8);--a 3-fold of degree 15 in P7 with betti table of |
|                                                                             |
|o16 : Ideal of U                                                             |
